      "id": 1,
      "text": "Newlands was granted to Governor Willem Adriaan van der Stel in 1700, originally called De Nieuwe Land or Nieuwland.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
